'''Ancient Egg: N102''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 10 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]]. [[True Form]] overhauls stats, increases cost while gaining Behemoth Slayer and immunity to slow.

