==Trivia==
*Catarzan's portal looks nearly identical to the one that [[Gacha Cat (Special Cat)|Gacha Cat]] is suspended from.
*Catarzan's name, design and attack animation directly reference the character [[wikipedia:Tarzan|Tarzan]].
*The line, "Hunting for food to meet his wife's bottomless appetite," in Catarzan's description may be referring to Jane, Tar-chan's gluttonous wife in the manga ''[[wikipedia:Jungle King Tar-chan|Jungle King Tar-chan]]''.

